    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a miner, traveling in your ship from asteroid to asteroid to find and collect the most important and valuable minerals. Survive attacks from an unknown and mysterious threat that is putting all existence in danger. Improve your ship and build the ultimate artifact to save the galaxy and all living beings with it. If your ship gets destroyed, we hope another miner will continue your mission.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE AND MINE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to asteroids and explore them, mine them to collect minerals, scraps and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113690/extras/eb56692b18fe424839603812bec8fa27.poster.avif?t=1752522106\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113690/extras/eb56692b18fe424839603812bec8fa27.webm?t=1752522106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPROVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your resources to upgrade your ship with triple mining rays or photon thrusters, and build drones to help in your task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113690/extras/35997637667a1c20af2007c40dd4d2a7.poster.avif?t=1752522106\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113690/extras/35997637667a1c20af2007c40dd4d2a7.webm?t=1752522106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy is full of dangers, from pirate ships to unknown threats from beyond The Anomaly, use your skills and upgrades to survive and complete The Mission<i>.\u00a0 </i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113690/extras/deae1cbcb4e8883055686abe3425d01f.poster.avif?t=1752522106\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113690/extras/deae1cbcb4e8883055686abe3425d01f.webm?t=1752522106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0 </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a miner, traveling in your ship from asteroid to asteroid to find and collect the most important and valuable minerals. Survive attacks from an unknown and mysterious threat that is putting all existence in danger. Improve your ship and build the ultimate artifact to save the galaxy and all living beings with it. If your ship gets destroyed, we hope another miner will continue your mission.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE AND MINE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to asteroids and explore them, mine them to collect minerals, scraps and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113690/extras/eb56692b18fe424839603812bec8fa27.poster.avif?t=1752522106\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113690/extras/eb56692b18fe424839603812bec8fa27.webm?t=1752522106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPROVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your resources to upgrade your ship with triple mining rays or photon thrusters, and build drones to help in your task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113690/extras/35997637667a1c20af2007c40dd4d2a7.poster.avif?t=1752522106\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113690/extras/35997637667a1c20af2007c40dd4d2a7.webm?t=1752522106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy is full of dangers, from pirate ships to unknown threats from beyond The Anomaly, use your skills and upgrades to survive and complete The Mission<i>.\u00a0 </i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113690/extras/deae1cbcb4e8883055686abe3425d01f.poster.avif?t=1752522106\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113690/extras/deae1cbcb4e8883055686abe3425d01f.webm?t=1752522106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0 </p>",
